    "body": "The maintainer decided the fix route: the switch of the STEP import to solidcore (#917). The worker of #917 makes a STEP fixture with a strongly twisted degree-3 B-spline face and confirms that the new importer reads it. If it does, the PR of #917 closes this issue. If it does not, this issue stays open and gets the result as a comment. Do not claim this issue separately before #917 has a PR.\n",
