    "body": "PR #2904 changes `Fixes #2780` to `Refs #2780`. Coordinator decision, recorded in `docs/decisions/917-solidcore-step.md`.\n\n- PR #2904 pins the twisted-flank reading and its refusal (kernel, geometry and app `step_twisted_flank.rs`).\n- The speed item (\"the import does not become slower by a large factor on the current fixtures\") stays open. #2844 holds it.\n- Dropped: timing runs of main against the branch in PR #2904. These need two more builds for a number that #2844 will change.\n\nThis issue stays open. It closes when #2844 gives the speed reading.\n",
